      "comment" : "Native apps only (TM-01): under the heading of the code step, instead of signIn.checkEmailBody. {email} is the address entered. Says the email has a code, without the sign-in link: a link tapped on the phone signs in the phone's browser, not the app. The instruction to enter the code comes from signIn.codeHelp. Deliberately does not say whether an account exists (no account enumeration).",
